symbol exiting
lines 0 2
hash bfa00d9b2bbfb663
note Drops the Renderer while the loop still holds the display connection. run_app consumes the event loop and closes the Wayland connection when it returns, and the runner outlives it; a Renderer dropped after that tears its GPU instance down against a closed connection, which with wgpu's GL backend (EGL on Wayland) segfaults on exit.

