author ai
file crates/platform/src/window.rs
symbol run
lines 0 40
hash 97a3f1068289157e
note The entry the gui crate calls: pick the window mode from the environment, create the event loop (for a fixed window through background::launch_without_focus, so on macOS the run never activates and never takes the keyboard), build the runner around the app and hand it to winit. It returns when the loop exits - the window closed or a frame asked to quit - and a failure to open the window or the GPU comes back as the StartError the runner kept, rather than a panic.

